cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-Matrix Global Analysis (MMGA_Lite)"
abstract: >-
  A minimal desktop application for global and target analysis of
  transient-absorption data. Lifetimes are shared across loaded matrices and
  the associated spectra (DAS / SAS / EADS) are recovered by variable
  projection.
type: software
